lt="zalando" class="absolute-image"/></div></div><div duration="3" am-group-el="grow-from" delay=".3" class="cta-item intuit"><div class="cta-aspect _8"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/66565001a8ed526f7b996412_intuit.svg" loading="lazy" alt="intuit" class="absolute-image"/></div></div></div></section><div class="section"><div class="background--light-grey"></div><div class="contain"><div class="intro__eyebrow">Resources</div><h2 class="intro__heading">Related content</h2><div class="related-content-container gx-2rem gy-4"><div id="w-node-feab89e3-2f98-0575-1035-d276c6097dde-4ba4c3a6" class="resources-block"><div id="w-node-feab89e3-2f98-0575-1035-d276c6097ddf-4ba4c3a6" class="resources__item"><p class="reporting-features__desktop__eyebrow">BLOG</p><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4badd4295725d075a5252_ai-for-software.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4badd4295725d075a5252_ai-for-software-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4badd4295725d075a5252_ai-for-software.webp 800w" alt="" class="resources__img__top__rnd"/><div class="resources__content"><h3 class="mt-4">AI for software developers: Why performance reporting is critical (and complicated)</h3><p>At least 60% of Zenhub’s software developers are using AI in the workplace. And that’s great. In theory.</p><a href="https://blog.zenhub.com/developer-productivity-tools-that-help-you-stay-on-track/" target="_blank" class="button tertiary arrow mb-4 w-inline-block"><div class="button-text">Read more</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/629527ac9d44785ab936b3dd_arrow-right.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="arrow-svg"/></a></div><a href="https://blog.zenhub.com/ai-for-software-developers-why-performance-reporting-is-critical-and-complicated/" target="_blank" class="block-link w-inline-block"></a></div></div><div id="w-node-feab89e3-2f98-0575-1035-d276c6097ded-4ba4c3a6" class="resources-block"><div id="w-node-feab89e3-2f98-0575-1035-d276c6097dee-4ba4c3a6" class="resources__item"><p class="reporting-features__desktop__eyebrow">BLOG</p><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4baf33db16cd0191b71e2_zenhub-ai-blog.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4baf33db16cd0191b71e2_zenhub-ai-blog-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4baf33db16cd0191b71e2_zenhub-ai-blog.webp 800w" alt="" class="resources__img__top__rnd"/><div class="resources__content"><h3 class="mt-4">Introducing Zenhub AI: The next frontier for Zenhub</h3><p>At Zenhub, we’ve always believed developers do their best work when project management and other admin tasks aren’t bogging them down. This is.</p><a href="https://blog.zenhub.com/developer-productivity-tools-that-help-you-stay-on-track/" target="_blank" class="button tertiary arrow mb-4 w-inline-block"><div class="button-text">Read more</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/629527ac9d44785ab936b3dd_arrow-right.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="arrow-svg"/></a></div><a href="https://blog.zenhub.com/introducing-zenhub-ai-the-next-frontier-for-zenhub/" target="_blank" class="block-link w-inline-block"></a></div></div><div id="w-node-feab89e3-2f98-0575-1035-d276c6097dfc-4ba4c3a6" class="resources-block"><div id="w-node-feab89e3-2f98-0575-1035-d276c6097dfd-4ba4c3a6" class="resources__item"><p class="reporting-features__desktop__eyebrow">guide</p><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4bb09a89136c45f9a46e1_defenitive-guide.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4bb09a89136c45f9a46e1_defenitive-guide-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/64d4bb09a89136c45f9a46e1_defenitive-guide.webp 800w" alt="" class="resources__img__top__rnd"/><div class="resources__content"><h3 class="mt-4">Project Management for Teams in GitHub</h3><p>Learn how to build better software and foster a more collaborative team. Every chapter of our new book is packed with expert advice and real-world examples your team can start using today.</p><a href="/github-project-management" class="button tertiary arrow mb-4 w-inline-block"><div class="button-text">Read the guide</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62827cf4fe5eb528708511d4/629527ac9d44785ab936b3dd_arrow-right.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="arrow-svg"/></a></div><a href="/github-project-management" class="block-link w-inline-block"></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section--subscribe"><div class="background--electric-green"></div><a href="#" class="close-box w-inline-block"><div role="button" data-w-id="feab89e3-2f98-0575-1035-d276c6097e0e" class="svg-close w-embed"><svg width="21" height="22" viewBox="0 0 21 22" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
